## 4. Scientific honesty notice (not a license, but belongs next to one)

Docking scores produced by this package are **Vina scoring-function values**, not
measured affinities. The bundled case is a **co-crystal redocking self-check**
(dock the crystallographic ligand back into its own structure); a low RMSD proves the
protocol reproduces a known pose, not that any molecule inhibits anything.
See `docs/方法说明.md` §限制.
